	(text "Position display: 15 POS lines (counter common J4) -> 15 light input buffers -> bit coil buses -> per digit a contact tree\nof 25 changeover contacts (13 G6S-2) -> exactly one of 26 letter lamps.  Supply +24V_L.  Display only (decision 0003 4.5)."
